---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Nexa — Digital marketing agency" description="Strategy, design and content for ambitious brands ready to move forward.">
  <header class="site-header" data-header><a class="brand-logo-link" href="/en/" aria-label="Nexa Digital Agency, home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/nexa-logo.svg" alt="Nexa Digital Agency" /></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#clients">Clients</a><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="/en/trabajos/">Work</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav><div class="header-actions"><a class="language-switch" href="/" lang="es" onclick="localStorage.setItem('nexa-language', 'es')">ES</a><a class="header-cta" href="#contact">Let’s talk <span>↗</span></a></div></header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero hero-full" id="home" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-media-stage" aria-hidden="true"><video class="hero-video is-active" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"><source src="/nexa-showreel.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video></div><div class="hero-shade"></div><div class="hero-content reveal"><div class="hero-slide"><h1 id="hero-title">Ideas that<br /><em>move.</em></h1><p>We build brands with strategy, creativity and the energy to make people stop, look and remember.</p></div><a class="hero-link" href="#services">See how we work <span>↓</span></a></div></section>
    <div class="ticker" aria-label="Areas of work"><div class="ticker-track"><div>Branding <b>✳</b> Digital <b>✳</b> Content <b>✳</b> Paid Media <b>✳</b> Branding <b>✳</b> Digital <b>✳</b></div><div aria-hidden="true">Branding <b>✳</b> Digital <b>✳</b> Content <b>✳</b> Paid Media <b>✳</b> Branding <b>✳</b> Digital <b>✳</b></div></div></div>
    <section class="intro section-grid" id="about" aria-labelledby="intro-title"><div class="intro-body reveal"><h2 id="intro-title">Being there is not enough.<br /><span>Make</span> an <em>impression.</em></h2><p>We get close to the business, find the tension and turn it into an idea people want to notice, remember and share.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Discover our approach <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section class="immersive-break" aria-labelledby="immersive-title"><div class="immersive-stage"><img class="immersive-fallback" src="/images/branding-v2.png" alt="" /><canvas id="scroll-canvas" aria-label="Interactive 3D Nexa scene"></canvas></div><div class="immersive-copy" id="immersive-title"><article class="immersive-step is-active"><span>01</span><h2>An idea<br /><em>appears.</em></h2><p>We start with a tension, a question or an opportunity.</p></article><article class="immersive-step"><span>02</span><h2>The shape<br /><em>changes.</em></h2><p>We test, mix and give structure to what does not exist yet.</p></article><article class="immersive-step"><span>03</span><h2>The brand<br /><em>moves.</em></h2><p>We turn the idea into an experience that moves with people.</p></article></div></section>
    <section class="services section-grid" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-title"><div class="service-content"><h2 id="services-title">Services</h2><div class="service-list service-accordion"><details class="service-card" open><summary><span>01</span><strong>Graphic design</strong><i>+</i></summary><div class="service-detail"><div><p>Clear, recognisable visual systems for complex ideas.</p><a href="#contact">Let’s talk about your project ↗</a></div><img src="/images/graphic-v2.png" alt="Editorial graphic design direction" loading="lazy" /></div></details><details class="service-card"><summary><span>02</span><strong>Branding</strong><i>+</i></summary><div class="service-detail"><div><p>We define the voice, language and presence that make a brand recognisable.</p><a href="#contact">Let’s talk about your project ↗</a></div><img src="/images/branding-v2.png" alt="Brand identity materials" loading="lazy" /></div></details><details class="service-card"><summary><span>03</span><strong>Digital strategy &amp; creativity</strong><i>+</i></summary><div class="service-detail"><div><p>Ideas that connect business goals with relevant cultural conversations.</p><a href="#contact">Let’s talk about your project ↗</a></div><img src="/images/strategy-v2.png" alt="Digital creative direction" loading="lazy" /></div></details><details class="service-card"><summary><span>04</span><strong>Web design</strong><i>+</i></summary><div class="service-detail"><div><p>Fast, memorable websites prepared to turn visits into opportunities.</p><a href="/en/trabajos/">See our work ↗</a></div><img src="/images/web-v2.png" alt="Digital web experience" loading="lazy" /></div></details></div></div></section>
    <section class="work-preview section-grid" aria-labelledby="work-title"><div class="work-body"><div class="work-heading"><h2 id="work-title">The work<br /><em>speaks.</em></h2><p>A selection of identities, campaigns and digital experiences built to give brands their own place in the world.</p><p>Every piece starts with a decision: understand the context, find the tension and turn it into something people want to see, remember and share.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/trabajos/">See all projects <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="work-feature"><a class="work-card" href="/en/trabajos/"><img src="/images/marea-case.png" alt="Marea art direction case study" loading="lazy" /><div><span>Case study / Marea</span><b>↗</b></div></a><div class="work-meta"><span>01 / Marea</span><span>Branding + Digital</span><strong>An identity with a pulse, made to change pace.</strong></div></div></div><div class="work-projects"><a class="work-project" href="/en/trabajos/"><img src="/images/norte-case.png" alt="Norte identity project" loading="lazy" /><div><span>02 / Norte</span><b>Identity &amp; strategy ↗</b></div></a><a class="work-project" href="/en/trabajos/"><img src="/images/orbita-case.png" alt="Orbita campaign project" loading="lazy" /><div><span>03 / Orbita</span><b>Campaign &amp; paid media ↗</b></div></a><a class="work-project work-project-solid" href="#contact"><div><span>04 / Next project</span><strong>Your brand<br /><em>here.</em></strong><b>Let’s talk ↗</b></div></a></div></section>
    <section class="clients section-grid" id="clients" aria-labelledby="clients-title"><div class="client-content"><h2 id="clients-title">Brands that<br /><em>trust us.</em></h2><div class="client-logos" aria-label="Nexa clients"><span>marea</span><span class="serif">norte</span><span>ORBITA</span><span class="serif italic">studio 44</span><span>croma<span class="lime">.</span></span><span class="serif">lumen</span></div></div></section>
    <section class="contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><div class="contact-inner"><div><h2 id="contact-title">Have something<br /><em>in mind?</em></h2><p class="contact-intro">Tell us what you want to move. We will reply with a first perspective, a question and a clear next step.</p><div class="contact-channels"><a href="mailto:hola@nexa.agency"><small>Email</small><span>hola@nexa.agency ↗</span></a><a href="https://wa.me/34600000000" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><small>WhatsApp</small><span>Write to us ↗</span></a><span><small>Based in</small><span>Madrid / Spain</span></span></div></div><form class="contact-form" action="mailto:hola@nexa.agency" method="post" enctype="text/plain"><div class="form-field"><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required /></div><div class="form-field"><label for="email">Your email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></div><div class="form-field form-field-wide"><label for="message">Tell us about the project</label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" required></textarea></div><button class="form-submit" type="submit">Send project <span>↗</span></button></form></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer><div class="footer-main"><a class="brand-logo-link" href="/en/" aria-label="Nexa Digital Agency, home"><img class="brand-logo brand-logo-footer" src="/nexa-logo.svg" alt="Nexa Digital Agency" /></a><p>Marketing with intention.<br />Strategy, identity and movement.</p><a class="footer-mail" href="mailto:hola@nexa.agency">hola@nexa.agency ↗</a></div><div class="footer-bottom"><nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href="#clients">Clients</a><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="/en/trabajos/">Work</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav><span>Madrid / Spain</span><span>© Nexa 2026</span></div></footer>
  <script>import '../../scripts/scroll-scene'; import { gsap } from 'gsap'; import { ScrollTrigger } from 'gsap/ScrollTrigger'; gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger); if (!window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) document.fonts.ready.then(() => { gsap.to('.ticker-track', { xPercent: -50, duration: 18, repeat: -1, ease: 'none' }); });</script>
</BaseLayout>
